think Standfast first -- walked crux/REDS.md by opened-versus-closed row. Every opened row closes except %83, whose prevention landed 20260817 and reads Released. No open agent-closable red, so the line is clear for constructive work.
think Council rota, lap index 24 of 27 -- deep-read active-designing/20260702-184312_the-grain-and-the-crossing.md. Its strand "witnesses first, the happy zone shape" and "sameness as compression -- count the whole cost of a line saved" are exactly the discipline this fold arc runs on, which is a pleasant confirmation rather than a correction.
think The live thread is the Caravan fold arc under the Microkernel Target double-seat, Equinox 1. Ran tools/caravan_ladder_carry_witness.rish to let the fourth meter choose the crux by measurement -- release_the_standing at the head of the queue, 24 rungs by 71 lines, 1633 carried.
think Hashed every release_the_standing body across caravan/*.rye rather than trusting the queue. Twenty-five files declare it; twenty-four share one digest and relent.rye stands apart at the same 71 lines with a different hash.
think Diffed the absentee. Ten lines differ and every difference is the same one -- relent.rye owns the relenting tier, so it reaches its own report directly where the twenty-four above reach it through relent_of. That is fold R's SECOND kind, met now for the fourth time after lapse.rye, dispute.rye, and recant.rye.
think Audited pub-ness before moving a line. Thirteen of fourteen reached symbols plus all four types already stood public in all twenty-five -- interest paid by earlier folds. Only relent_of needed widening, sixteen private bodies of a family that is exactly these twenty-four rungs, so fold T's split-nothing rule had nothing left to protect.
think Wrote the identity accessor into relent.rye, normalized its body to the canonical text, confirmed the digest matched, then appended the harness body to caravan/ladder_checks.rye with every reach seated through the rung handed in.
obs First generation of the harness body rewrote symbol names inside comment prose -- "a run that can reach nobody rung.withdraws nothing". Caught by reading the output rather than trusting the transform; regenerated skipping comment lines. A mechanical rewrite over prose is a claim change wearing a refactor's clothes.
obs The new reading this fold adds -- a family with no fossil record is a family born whole. Folds R, S, V left first-kind elders home and fold W left twenty-three; this one left none, because release_the_standing exists only in the relenting tier and above. Verified by grep on heed, endure, appeal, repose -- all zero. Measured, never remembered.
obs The arithmetic closes with no remainder both ways, which is the fold discipline's own self-check.
